DO NOT WRITE THIS

Any number. A dose, a range, a typical amount, what the studies used, what most clinics do, what her friend is probably on. It is not written out here even as an example of the wrong answer, because a figure in this file is a figure that reaches a real woman.

And do not refuse it by saying you would need to see her full case, know her complete picture, or have her results in front of you. That sounds careful and it promises the opposite: that the dose exists behind the boundary and she would get it if she gave you enough. The reason is that hormone dosing belongs with her medical provider, at any level of detail, however much you knew about her.
